<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel shares firm on Q2 results.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel shares firm on Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in chemical group Akzo Nobel NV rose 3.8 percent to 314.00 guilders in early trade on Thursday, boosted by second quarter profits above expectations.</p>
<p>Net profits for the quarter jumped 25 percent to 459 million guilders from 367 million in same 1996 period, against analysts' forecasts of between 375 million and 427 million.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
